  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Capacity building in optometric education in the context of eye health and global blindness prevention, with the aim of developing faculty or leaders, strengthen education systems and affect change in the realm of global eye health. The project will also consolidate their collaborative knowledge on workforce development for optometry programs. Kenya, Norway and South Africa</narrative>
  </description>
